  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "Given ${ }^m C,{ }^m C,{ }^m C_{r+1}$ are in A.P.\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n& 2{ }^m C_r={ }^m C_{r-1}+{ }^m C_{r+1} \\\\\n& \\Rightarrow 2=\\frac{{ }^m C_{r-1}}{{ }^m C_r}+\\frac{{ }^m C_{r+1}}{{ }^m C_r} \\\\\n& =\\frac{r}{m-r+1}+\\frac{m-r}{r+1} \\\\\n& \\Rightarrow m^2-m(4 r+1)+4 r^2-2=0\n\\end{aligned}\n$$",
    "image": null
  },
